## What Overwatch OS Is Becoming

The goal is no longer just prediction.

The goal is building systems that help people make better decisions over time.

Conceptually, the workflow looks like this:

```text
Human Operators
↓
Data Inputs
↓
AI Analysis
↓
Risk & Verification
↓
Execution Decisions
↓
Feedback Loop
↓
Long-Term Optimization
```
